in the scheme of things,

00:07:27.361 --> 00:07:29.544
so I expect this to be
where you're coming from.

00:07:29.544 --> 00:07:31.796
Look, you have to ask.

00:07:31.796 --> 00:07:33.444
You can't be scared to ask for money.

00:07:33.444 --> 00:07:35.302
You have to ask, and you
have to price yourself,

00:07:35.302 --> 00:07:36.439
and you have to price yourself

00:07:36.439 --> 00:07:38.158
in a way that makes you feel good.

00:07:38.158 --> 00:07:41.106
And so whether that's $100
an hour, $500 an hour,

00:07:41.106 --> 00:07:42.395
